// Windows resource script for Virial.
// Bundles the multi-resolution .ico into the executable and links the
// application manifest so the launcher uses Common Controls v6 and
// honours per-monitor DPI v2. Without this the .exe would inherit a
// generic icon (no install/desktop/taskbar branding) and pick up the
// blurry GDI-bits-stretching behaviour of legacy DPI awareness.
//
// IDs:
//   1 = main application icon (PNG-encoded .ico with 16,24,32,48,64,128,256)
//   2 = explicit RT_MANIFEST resource referenced from `manifest` below.

1 ICON "virial-gpui.ico"
2 RT_MANIFEST "virial-gpui.manifest"